4264e18832768d7014a23be67dfcd0469ab2ab676c20, seal 6,321,372 B; gate verdict records the libtcc1 CBMC T3 demotion + 2 stale listings from the F44 append (proof-track re-issue). Residues named in PATCHES.md F42-F44 and the tier REPORT.md D9 section (constexpr arrays named-reject; pointer-constexpr string permissive; alignas frame-local upstream behaviour; BITINT_MAXWIDTH cap diverge-with-class). h8 escalation COMPLETE 2026-11-08: portfolio-union 273/304, T3 NOT GRANTED, residue characterized (Branch E structural at 300s; W_div open under all three provers; pow32 unproven in every context); 4 open VCs genuinely FALSE (pre-F1 transcription — re-transcription decision, not prover time); receipt port DEFERRED to the D9 tip (re-derived fresh; do not assume the D7-era receipt sha ec07cb27…). Wave D9 PUBLISHED 2026-11-08 at tip 611b763e (main == exo), publisher-verified from a fresh clone (see results). The h8 receipt port's parent is now 611b763e — port unblocked, to be re-derived fresh against phext 300b404e.... h8 receipt port COMPLETE 2026-11-08 at tip f65e68cc (main == exo; see results): the escalation addendum is in the canonical phext, verdict re-issued byte-reproducibly, seal regenerated; Item 11 closed as a record, T3 NOT GRANTED stands. Remaining programme: Wave D10 (PQ-25 codegen half, PQ-26, PQ-27), then release packaging (milestone 10). F49 FIXED 2026-11-08 (the -g/nullptr_t debug-walker regression D10 filed): local stack fed1715e + 5c81be62 on 8696a8e6, awaiting coordinator publish. PQ-28 filed (F47 type_is_vm; block-scope nullptr_t declarator; -g-independent).

