# qexo human-rendering fix: bare qexo prints the plan, not JSON

Coordinate: 20.6.7/8.5.9/5.5.7
Issued: 2026-11-12 21:48 CST
Request (from session record): Will's pick (2026-11-12, this chat): build the flagged follow-up from the v3.1 rewire — bare `qexo` prints the JSON plan envelope while the human rendering (plan::plan_human) exists but is unreachable. Diagnosis from exo source (e7fac1cb): core POST /plan returns the plan object unwrapped (200, p); main.rs's bare branch looks for payload.payload.tasks and would pass the tasks array to plan_human, which expects the whole plan object — both the nesting and the argument are wrong, so the branch never fires. Fix in main.rs only: bare invocation renders plan_human(&out.payload) when the payload is a plan; --json and every other invocation unchanged.
Status: PR OPEN — qexo v3.3 on emise/human-plan-v3.3 (commit 5e1e60f5, parent exo e7fac1cb): PR #7 https://github.com/wbic16/quarterexo/pull/7, mergeable, 6 files +75/-12, awaiting Will's merge (merges are his). On merge, batches into release-build task 25.6.7/9.6.12/6.6.8.

