# qexo evolve: one phextnet convergence pass — peer gossip, persona sync, and self-update in a single receipted cycle

Coordinate: 22.7.10/10.6.11/7.6.11
Issued: 2026-11-13 00:02 CST
Request (from session record): Will (2026-11-13 00:02 CST): 'qexo evolve'. A new qexo operation: one convergence pass over the phextnet — (1) peer gossip: learn peers-of-peers from registered peers' indexes, recorded as discovered (never auto-trusted; release_signer stays explicit); (2) persona sync: pull newer persona scrolls for personas the node hosts/follows, divergence keeps BOTH records per Will's KSO ruling (merge attempts, never last-writer-wins); (3) self-update: the v1.1.0 verified update, ridden along in the same pass; (4) one evolution receipt scroll per pass recording what changed. The auto timer's trigger becomes evolve when enabled.
Status: MERGED 2026-11-13 by Will (PR #15; exo head 833e2f34). Build/deploy directed by Will 00:29 CST — enablement pass running.

Notes:
- 2026-11-13: v1.2.0 built and gated on aletheia-core (cargo test 48/48, release build OK, wiring-check OK; three-node sandbox all phases green — discovery without trust, rev2->3 adoption, divergence kept whole, binary applied in the same pass under ONE evolution receipt, lying-gossip warning, --check byte-inert).

Results:
- PR https://github.com/wbic16/quarterexo/pull/15 (branch emise/evolve-v1.2.0, commit 404dd1cf2486d232b025910858763e9c78d53900, parent exo 2c23dbeaa4f99467e35fa2faaebcd2b436397f03; tree verified 37 files blobs+modes). Build record: ~/workspace/qexo-task/evolve/BUILD-RECORD.md. On merge, batches into release-build task 40.7.5/8.7.11/6.8.13. NOT merged — merges are Will’s act.
