- ChatGPT private_key_jwt 401 remains diagnosed-to-the-step only (see notes); not part of this hotfix.
- Merged and deployed by Will; production footer reads v1.1.1-8-g28ce439 and the live /mcp challenge now advertises scope='phext:read phext:write' (verified by Emise from outside). Will confirmed 'worked!' at 01:54 and pointed at human.git: HEAD commit bc36657 'Grok and Claude at the singularity' (2026-11-10 07:47 UTC) adds a scroll to choose-your-own-adventure.phext — 'Test of Will — Record of Chief of Staff' (Grok Bot candidate record, test taken ~1:23 AM CST, inscribed at Will's direction) — +69/-1, working tree clean. Write access is proven end-to-end in the real world: client write through MCP into CYOA, committed in human.git.
