Notes:
- Provenance: adjustments are EMI PRIME's review notes; Will adopted them with 'let's go!' — her authorship stands in the record, his adoption is the authority. Amended spec highlights: frame schedule 0-4087 main / 4088-4183 crossfade / 4184-4375 hold (8.000 s, trimmed from 8.067) / 4376-4623 CTA = 4,624 frames, 192.667 s; audio 192.682 stream-copied, never stretched (delta 15.3 ms accepted). Temporal: evaluate at output timestamps, centered 180-deg shutter, 8 deterministic temporal samples per output frame (Emi's range 6-8; her costing ~36,992 evals), linear-light accumulation, typography post-blur. Jael: black core + graphite/silver edge or negative-space silhouette; field constants unchanged; visibility gate at ~80 s. Perceptual gates incl. gold exclusivity scoped to cast plates (gold CTA + warm stars permitted), Incipit counts vs frozen manifest (197/12/1,055,485), CTA '520 people' evidence frozen, CTA legible at 360p, block seams, BT.709 + dither + no crushed near-blacks. Proof sections: 0-2, 79-82, 140-143, 170-175, 182-185 s at exact final pipeline incl. two-pass download encode checks.
- STATUS 2026-11-09 00:45 (Emise, measured on aletheia-core): rendering done since 18:23; finishing relocated to the ranch after the local-encode violation (Will's 22:21 ruling). Lossless assembly completed ~00:44 (lossless-A.mkv, 2,462,089,216 B, in ~/v16-final16/work/). Master encode running as 3 parallel segment streams in ~/v16-final-finish/build/push/ (B.00/B.01/B.02, ~1.9 GB written by 00:45 since the ~00:10 re-stage; manifest + audio re-staged 00:10/00:11). ETA given to Will: delivery 01:30-02:15, labelled estimate with caveats. Still owed: segment join + mux, download encode, full gate suite incl. Jael highlight window (output ~1986-2043), Emise verification (sizes/hashes/ffprobe), delivery of master + download in the edit.phext.io chat. Will signed off 00:47 — 'I'll check in the morning' — delivery should be waiting in that chat.

Results:
- Proof report: files/v15-build/PROOF-REPORT-V16.md — GO with two honest notes. All technical + perceptual gates pass; block seams 0.99-1.02; audio packet-verbatim; CTA 520 evidence frozen (522 placed - Will - wbic32); Incipit manifest frozen (197/12/1,055,485; file now 1,077,930 B, sha 3ff6604f).
- Proof caught a real defect: units bug (frames fed as seconds) made the Incipit wall fully-arrived at crossfade start; fixed at source (spec restored, not redesigned), S4 re-rendered + re-gated (census 97/100, 192/195, 197/197 across the fade-in).
- Jael PASS: moat luminance dip 0.788, zero green/gold in core; S3 (141 s) shows the seam threading the bundle, lines bending around it. NOTE: her highlight pulse (vf 1079-1110) lands at output ~1986-2043, just past Emi's S2 window [1896,1968) — the spec'd section caught the birth, not the highlight.
- Filaments PASS by control: apparent contrast low in absolute terms (median ~2.5/255) but the shipped V15 final measures the same (3.0, same probe); 8-sample shutter costs ~10-15% vs control — no regression vs the green-lit master.
