Status: in progress — upstream main verified unmoved since db3ed30 (site in sync with main; UX-fix build live); Ian's daily publishes are on argimenes branch dialectic-app (main + 35 commits, latest 2026-11-12); band trial onto dialectic-app conflicts in 7 files; upstream phext PR (Part B) being opened via browser

Notes:
- The /tmp/pr-title.txt + pr-body.md staged on aletheia-core 2026-11-09 are a phext-LATTICE MCP PR text, not the mutable PR — caught before use; mutable PR body drafted fresh from PATCHES.md.
- Decision for Will: re-point the sync/deploy watch from upstream main to dialectic-app, or stay on main.
