Notes:
- Will, MOAT, 2026-11-11 00:45 CST. Interjection log entry 4 written (arrived ~1 min into the invisible demo run; judged additive/frame-raising, demo untouched). Coordinator dispatched: Pass 1 derive principles from definitions (paper, reference, typesetting, reading, authorship cost) with analogy banned; Pass 2 a separate critic agent in Knuth's register (exact costs, algorithm demands, METAFONT and literate-programming tests); Pass 3 reconcile + verdict on DESIGN.md (keep/amend/propose - proposals NOT applied), publish + re-inscribe. Math syntax explicitly out of scope (requirements only); demo dependency noted, not waited on.
- 2026-11-11 00:47 CST: Will named the motto - 'Phextura: Rigorous Delight'. Sent into the loop: README tagline, the loop's explicit grading standard (rigorous AND delightful), and the critic's bar by name. Recorded in MEMORY.md.
- 2026-11-11 00:48 CST: Will added the persona panel - embed Knuth/Newton/Einstein reviewer personas that shred a paper in real time when an MCP agent opens it. Sent into the loop as a candidate derived component with honesty requirements (labelled simulation, sourced distillation, addressed marginalia); applied only if it derives, else it returns as a proposal.
- COMPLETED 2026-11-11 01:06 CST. Three passes ran. 14 principles derived; P6 (layout vocabulary) DIED - demoted to open requirement, METAFONT correspondence judged 'a metaphor wearing a suit'; P14 died as stated - delight replaced by a measured benchmark-suite obligation; P11 rebuilt from status field into a WARRANT GRAPH after the critic's hardest hit (existence of a proof scroll is not entailment; 'proved-here' was self-awarded laundering). Critic also caught Pass 1's demerits formula written from memory (wrong; real formula three-cased by penalty sign) and instituted: every claim about an existing system carries a checkable citation or is struck. DESIGN.md verdicts: KEEP 2, AMEND 9 (applied: governed role growth per F2, heading home + honest section depth F3, one float one address F4, bib text: normative F5, warrant edges, provenance graph, Sec 5.2 annotation corpora = the DERIVED half of the persona panel), PROPOSE 3 held for Will unapplied: (1) Persona Panel as shipped component (marginalia derived; personas-as-persons do not derive; critic: Rigorous 2/5, Delightful 4/5), (2) edition-qualified external citation standard, (3) cross-paper author identity registry. Published phextura@exo d894c94f (parent = demo commit 2b3909a after one rejected push, cherry-picked, no force), README carries the motto; re-inscribed at 34.6.7/7.6.11/6.5.10, human@exo f9b181a0, clone-verified. Open, honestly: layout constraint vocabulary (UNPRICED), warrant display policy, P9 laws vs libphext, delight benchmark suite, math syntax + macro home (F1), native proof format conjunction, concurrent authorship. Defect noted: demo/friction.md truncated on disk inside F11 (~1 KB lost in the demo's write; substance recovered, recorded in design-verdicts.md).
