ilure analysis under windows/attestation/records/, and a 'Running the attestation' pointer in docs/CONFORMANCE.md — LOCAL commits 2707a31 (tooling) + 3eed671 (records+docs) on tip a3b1a8e6 in ~/phcc-attest-v2/tree on rock-mountain; coordinator publishes (a rename stack is in flight in parallel). Re-run under MSVC is Will's.
